text 1607b42aa2fb
<p>The leader sends a heartbeat every <strong>50 ms</strong>, and a follower that hears
nothing for a <em>random</em> time starts an election.</p>
<ul><li>A follower waits.</li><li>A candidate asks for votes.<ol start="1"><li>It votes for itself.</li><li>It sends <code>RequestVote</code> to every peer.</li></ol></li></ul>
<p>The paper is at <a href="https://raft.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the Raft site</a>, and the
notes of the course are in <span class="md-link" title="notes/raft.md">notes</span>.
A line ends here,<br>and a hard break keeps the next one apart.</p>
<ul><li><span class="md-task">☑</span> Read the paper</li><li><span class="md-task">☐</span> Read the code</li></ul>
<p><del>The old rule</del> is gone.</p>
<hr>
<p>An image inside a line is not a block: <span class="md-image" title="img/flow.png">the flow</span> and
<a class="md-image" href="https://example.com/logo.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">a logo</a> both stay links.</p>
<blockquote><p>[!WARNING]
A quote with a marker that is not a callout stays text.</p></blockquote>
